## Initial build (M0–M8, shipped 2026-08)

All nine milestones landed in order, one commit each, every gate green at
each step (88 tests at completion).

| Milestone | Delivered |
|---|---|
| M0 | Workspace scaffolding: kernel, wire, xtask; toolchain/dep pins resolved (deviations recorded in `docs/MILESTONE_REPORT.md`) |
| M1 | Ontology: `pack!` macro engine, dev-v1 pack (13 memory types, 12 entity types, 48 kinds), R-Pk/R-T validators |
| M2 | Storage: `Storage` trait, registered Cypher catalogue, FalkorDB adapter, InMemory double, bi-temporal reads |
| M3 | Cache + MCP client: ArcSwap snapshots, 2Q admission, sled WAL, stdio MCP server, search SLO bench (100k) |
| M4 | Reasoning: Crepe R1–R9 + D1–D6 fixpoints, Steel explain traces + R6, idempotent derived-edge writeback |
| M5 | Cluster: owner leases with epoch fencing, HMAC-signed envelopes, peer admission, SSE change feed |
| M6 | Ingestion: IngestService pipeline (HMAC → checksum → fingerprint → ceiling → triples), entity extraction, `end_session` tool, worker host |
| M7 | Operation registry: one entry per operation, MCP+HTTP schema parity, audit ledger, goldens |
| M8 | Dreams: MCR² + sparsity guardrails, consolidation cycle with rollback, trigger model, discovery proposals |

