reviously registry-only; offline ack local_lsns+sync_pending; invalid batches refused naming the offender; preflight code+detail+correction; version+hashes). The content/label legs fail red on the pre-D35 tree (the D35 stash evidence). Gates: clippy/fmt clean, `cargo test -p xtask acceptance` green, `cargo xtask acceptance-coverage` green with ai1 |
